bruary\nL196:     following a 0.6-percent increase the prior month. The shelter index was by far\nL197:     the biggest factor in the increase, with a broad set of indexes also\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTable 2. Consumer Price Index for All Urban Consumers (CPI-U): U. S. city average, by detailed expenditure category - 2026 M10 Results (https://www.bls.gov/news.release/cpi.t02.htm)\nciteturn6view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.bls.gov/news.release/cpi.t02.htm\",\"lineno\":175}); Total lines: 589\nL77:     * 【71†International】\nL78:     * 【72†International Technical Cooperation】\nL79:     * 【35†Import/Export Price Indexes】\nL80:     * 【73†Geographic Information】\nL81:     * 【74†Northeast (Boston-New York)】\nL82:     * 【75†Mid-Atlantic (Philadelphia)】\nL88:   * 【81†Data Tools】\nL89:     * 【82†Data Retrieval Tools】\nL90:     * 【83†BLS Popular Series†data.bls.gov】\nL91:     * 【84†Series Report†data.bls.gov】\nL92:     * 【85†Top Picks, One Screen, Multi-Screen, and Maps】\nL93:     * 【86†Data Finder†data.bls.gov】\nL94:     * 【87†Public Data API】\nL95:     * 【88†Charts and Applications】\nL96:     * 【89†Charts for Economic News Releases】\nL97:     * 【90†CPI Inflation Calculator】\nL98:     * 【91†Injury and Illness Calculator†data.bls.gov】\nL99:     * 【92†Pay Measure Comparison†data.bls.gov】\nL100:     * 【93†Demographic Data Sources†data.bls.gov】\nL101:     * 【94†COVID-19 Economic Trends†data.bls.gov】\nL102:     * 【95†Industry Productivity Viewer†data.bls.gov】\nL103:     * 【96†Employment and Wages Data Viewer†data.bls.gov】\nL104:     * 【97†Industry Finder from the Quarterly Census of Employment and Wages†data.bls.gov】\nL105:     * 【98†Customized Tables】\nL106:     * 【99†U.S. Economy at a Glance】\nL107:     * 【100†Regions, States & Areas at a Glance】\nL108:     * 【101†Industry at a Glance】\nL109:     * 【102†Text Files†download.bls.gov】\nL110:     * 【103†N